==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Special Clearance}}

==Battleground==
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[H. Nah]] spawns after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Razorback]]s spawn, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[H. Nah]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Raynard]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
When you hit the base, spam [[Dark Lazer]]. You won't even need [[Bombercat]], seeing Dark Lazer's insanely high DPS. Make sure to run [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to cleanup the H.Nahs and Camelles as well as [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] to snipe Raynard.

